Recorded interface data (test fixtures and catalogues)
------------------------------------------------------
To test interoperability offline, this repository contains small records of public interfaces of Atlassian
services and tools. They describe interfaces only (names, parameters, help text, schema shapes) and contain no
customer data. They remain the property of their respective owners and are included for compatibility testing:

  atlian_assiant/backends/mcp/catalog_v2.json         tool / operation names and input names of the Atlassian Rovo MCP server
  tests/backends/fixtures/agg_schema_subset.graphql   the subset of the Atlassian GraphQL gateway schema used by the stored queries
  tests/cli/fixtures/acli_*/                          `--help` output of the Atlassian CLI (acli)
  tests/cli/fixtures/twg_*/                           `--help` output of the Teamwork Graph CLI (twg)
  specs/openapi/*.json                                a hand-written subset of Atlassian's published OpenAPI descriptions

Third-party dependencies are installed separately and keep their own licenses (see pyproject.toml).
